<title>POLAND: GORAZDZE TO BUY MINERAL MINE FROM NFIS.</title>
<headline>GORAZDZE TO BUY MINERAL MINE FROM NFIS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cement plant Gorazdze SA said on Friday it had signed an intitial agreement with 15 National Investment Funds on buying 60 percent of shares in mineral mine Zielonogorska Kopalnia Surowcow Mineralnych SA from them.</p>
<p>Gorazdze said in a statement it would buy a 33 percent stake from the National Investment Fund No. 8 and a 27 percent equity from the remaining funds.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
